{{!--
    The context bar while a world page has given way to the map (S0 step 4c-1): a homeland or an
    event's place is being picked on the Surface map, from the Cultures or Ages and events page's
    inspector (until step 4c-2 moves both to each map's Peoples and realms; board C10's state).
    Done, Escape or the click that places it brings the page back.
--}}
<div class="fwmb-contents fwmb-bar-world">
    <span class="fwmb-bar-world-map"><span class="fwmb-icon fwmb-icon--place" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{worldPick.label}} <b>{{worldPick.name}}</b></span>
    <span class="fwmb-bar-world-hint">{{localize "FILRODENSWMB.UI.PickingHint"}}</span>
    <button type="button" class="fwmb-btn fwmb-bar-world-done" data-action="stopWorldPick">{{localize "FILRODENSWMB.UI.Done"}}</button>
</div>
